Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.58,0:00:08.46,Italics,Shin,0,0,0,,Lieutenant Colonel.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.46,0:00:10.70,Main,Grethe,0,0,0,,Yes. I just saw them.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.70,0:00:12.61,Main,Grethe,0,0,0,,They've come to block our path.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.61,0:00:13.49,Italics,Shin,0,0,0,,Can we dodge them?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.49,0:00:15.10,Main,Grethe,0,0,0,,Not easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.10,0:00:18.50,Main,Grethe,0,0,0,,I told you. \NTurning's not this baby's thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.88,0:00:21.03,Main,Grethe,0,0,0,,I'll handle them.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.40,0:00:24.10,Main,Grethe,0,0,0,,Don't worry. Just head for the Morpho.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.10,0:00:25.26,Italics,Raiden,0,0,0,,How?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.26,0:00:28.50,Main,Grethe,0,0,0,,I was hoping I could land \Nbefore you got off, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.74,0:00:30.19,Italics,Anju,0,0,0,,Are you going to drop us?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.19,0:00:31.36,Italics,Theo,0,0,0,,From this altitude?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.36,0:00:36.36,Main,Grethe,0,0,0,,Don't worry! We built it really fast, \Nbut it should still work!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.89,0:00:39.38,Main,Grethe,0,0,0,,Don't worry about us.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.68,0:00:41.78,Main,Grethe,0,0,0,,I brought a spare.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.38,0:00:45.76,Italics,Shin,0,0,0,,Lt. Colonel, if you're just distracting the enemy, \Nyou don't need to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.03,0:00:49.12,Italics,Shin,0,0,0,,After making contact, \Nevacuate to the forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.12,0:00:51.05,Main,Grethe,0,0,0,,Oh, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.05,0:00:55.24,Main,Grethe,0,0,0,,But... don't underestimate me, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.30,0:01:00.40,Main,Grethe,0,0,0,,May the speed of the gods protect us!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.59,0:01:24.80,Italics,Kurena,0,0,0,,The Nachzehrer...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.80,0:01:27.52,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,Prepare for impact, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.25,0:01:42.54,Main,Anju,0,0,0,,Lieutenant Colonel...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.86,0:01:45.91,Italics,Shin,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.47,0:03:27.97,Main,Officers,0,0,0,,We've lost contact with the Nachzehrer!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.97,0:03:32.60,Main,Officers,0,0,0,,All troops were dropped before the signal was lost, \Nand they are still active.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.85,0:03:36.94,Main,Officers,0,0,0,,But we've just received word from Lt. Nouzen \Nthat they've encountered the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.27,0:03:39.61,Main,Officers,0,0,0,,The enemy has built a defensive perimeter.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.94,0:03:41.82,Main,Officers,0,0,0,,What's Nordlicht's situation?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.15,0:03:46.08,Main,Officers,0,0,0,,The task force is currently in combat \Nwith the Morpho's defenders
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.08,0:03:47.66,Main,Officers,0,0,0,,and is approaching the target.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.21,0:03:55.38,Italics,Anju,0,0,0,,Hey, are they leading us somewhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.38,0:03:56.96,Italics,Bernhardt,0,0,0,,Well, Commander?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.96,0:04:00.84,Italics,Raiden,0,0,0,,With this many around us, \NShin's ears alone can't help.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.84,0:04:03.43,Italics,Kurena,0,0,0,,We'll just have to keep going!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.11,0:04:17.02,Italics,Theo,0,0,0,,Here come some more!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.86,0:04:20.69,Italics,Theo,0,0,0,,Shin!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.95,0:04:33.12,Italics,Raiden,0,0,0,,That's it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.12,0:04:35.91,Italics,Theo,0,0,0,,It's that big?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.91,0:04:38.42,Italics,Anju,0,0,0,,The Morpho's kind of like a millipede.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.42,0:04:40.96,Italics,Kurena,0,0,0,,More like a centipede?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.96,0:04:43.38,Italics,Kurena,0,0,0,,It's got long legs, \Nand it's kind of squirming around.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.38,0:04:44.72,Italics,Theo,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.72,0:04:45.84,Italics,Theo,0,0,0,,It's disgusting either way.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.84,0:04:51.18,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,Læraðr HQ, we've sighted the enemy near the \Nhigh-speed train terminal at Kreutzbek City.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.68,0:04:53.89,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,It doesn't seem \Nto have finished its repairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.89,0:04:55.85,Italics,HQ Operator,0,0,0,,This is Læraðr HQ, roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.85,0:04:59.40,Italics,HQ Operator,0,0,0,,A United Kingdom observation unit is nearby.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.40,0:05:02.07,Italics,Shin,0,0,0,,Roger. We will now begin combat.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.70,0:05:07.61,Main,Kurena,0,0,0,,It moved!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.87,0:05:12.12,Italics,Kiri,0,0,0,,I'll kill you! I'll kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.37,0:05:14.37,Italics,Kiri,0,0,0,,I'll kill you! I'll kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.75,0:05:16.87,Italics,Kiri,0,0,0,,I'll kill you! I'll kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.12,0:05:19.38,Italics,Kiri,0,0,0,,I'll kill you! I'll kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.38,0:05:21.63,Italics,Kiri,0,0,0,,I'll kill you! I'll kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.63,0:05:25.88,Italics,Kiri,0,0,0,,I'll kill you! I'll kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.86,0:05:52.70,Italics Top,Kiri,0,0,0,,I'll kill you! I'll kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.37,0:05:52.70,Italics,Kurena,0,0,0,,It's fixed?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.70,0:05:53.45,Italics,Theo,0,0,0,,What do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.45,0:05:54.37,Italics,Bernhard,0,0,0,,Commander!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.04,0:05:57.75,Italics,Kiri,0,0,0,,I'll kill you! I'll kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.75,0:05:58.50,Italics,Kiri,0,0,0,,I'll...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.14,0:06:11.47,Italics,Frederica,0,0,0,,Get back, Shinei!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.47,0:06:13.85,Italics,Frederica,0,0,0,,What you're seeing isn't Kiri!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.06,0:06:15.35,Italics,Kiri,0,0,0,,I'll kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.77,0:06:18.89,Italics,Kiri,0,0,0,,I'll kill you all!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.73,0:06:25.15,Italics,Shin,0,0,0,,Everyone, retreat! Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.15,0:06:25.73,Italics,Raiden,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.73,0:06:26.78,Italics,Shin,0,0,0,,I'll explain later!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.11,0:06:28.28,Italics,Raiden,0,0,0,,Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.76,0:06:56.89,Main,Officer,0,0,0,,Impact confirmed \Nnear Kreutzbek City terminal!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.89,0:06:58.56,Main,Officer,0,0,0,,Likely a Morpho attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.56,0:06:59.44,Main,Officer,0,0,0,,Impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.44,0:07:01.35,Main,Officer,0,0,0,,It wasn't supposed to repair itself!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.06,0:07:04.94,Main,Willem,0,0,0,,If it wasn't a repair, but a swap-out...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.52,0:07:08.61,Main,Willem,0,0,0,,It would've been faster \Nto put an undamaged core into a spare.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.70,0:07:12.48,Main,Willem,0,0,0,,So they've succeeded in luring us out...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.03,0:07:18.04,Main,Officer 1,0,0,0,,All United Kingdom observers \Nwere lost in the attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.04,0:07:20.91,Main,Officer 2,0,0,0,,Those goddamn pieces of scrap!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.91,0:07:24.59,Main,Officer 3,0,0,0,,We've got no choice \Nbut to do a saturation missile strike.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.59,0:07:25.39,Main,Ernst,0,0,0,,It's useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.30,0:07:29.80,Main,Ernst,0,0,0,,Where would you fire these missiles?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.80,0:07:33.18,Main,Ernst,0,0,0,,We don't know the enemy's location.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.18,0:07:36.10,Main,Ernst,0,0,0,,Our radar's down. \NWe have no observation drones!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.10,0:07:37.72,Main,Officer 3,0,0,0,,It's a rail-based cannon!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.72,0:07:40.10,Main,Officer 3,0,0,0,,If we can destroy the tracks...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.10,0:07:43.94,Main,Ernst,0,0,0,,It can hit most of our forward bases \Nfrom where it is, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.94,0:07:47.02,Main,Ernst,0,0,0,,And they'd repair the rails in no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.02,0:07:48.79,Main,Ernst,0,0,0,,We'd be wasting missiles.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.28,0:07:53.25,Main,Officer 3,0,0,0,,With Nordlicht's failure, \Nwe have no other choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.57,0:07:56.87,Main,Officer 3,0,0,0,,We need to protect the western front \Nfrom artillery attack,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.87,0:07:58.54,Main,Officer 3,0,0,0,,even if it's just for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.54,0:08:01.36,Main,Ernst,0,0,0,,And what will you after "now" passes?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.75,0:08:04.12,Main,Ernst,0,0,0,,Send in another team?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.12,0:08:08.00,Main,Ernst,0,0,0,,Without even a way to open \Na path home for them?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.00,0:08:11.97,Main,Ernst,0,0,0,,Abandoning the soldiers you sent \Ninto enemy territory to protect yourself,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.97,0:08:14.34,Main,Ernst,0,0,0,,giving up on the rest of the plan...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.34,0:08:17.75,Main,Ernst,0,0,0,,That's disgusting behavior. \NBeneath humanity.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.75,0:08:22.52,Main,Ernst,0,0,0,,As the Federacy's provisional President \Nand its Commander-in-Chief,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.52,0:08:25.76,Main,Ernst,0,0,0,,do you think I'd allow that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.61,0:08:29.44,Main,Ernst,0,0,0,,The Federacy has higher ideals to uphold.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.94,0:08:38.16,Main,Ernst,0,0,0,,If we're talking about giving up on that, \Nwe'd be better off destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.30,0:08:45.54,Main,Ernst,0,0,0,,You allowed me become President,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.54,0:08:47.88,Main,Ernst,0,0,0,,and now you must live with the consequences!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.88,0:08:51.67,Main,Ernst,0,0,0,,If you insist that the only way \Nwe can survive is an unethical one,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.26,0:08:55.76,Main,Ernst,0,0,0,,then you'll have to die here \Nalong with my ideals.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.80,0:09:03.06,Main,Willem,0,0,0,,It seems that may be unnecessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.56,0:09:06.60,Main,Operator,0,0,0,,All members of Nordlicht have survived!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.15,0:09:09.90,Main,Operator,0,0,0,,They're still attempting to destroy the Morpho!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.87,0:09:24.75,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,To think the real one was somewhere else...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.12,0:09:27.37,Italics,Raiden,0,0,0,,Even you couldn't tell?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.75,0:09:30.71,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,We're changing targets, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.71,0:09:33.51,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,Heading 2-8-0. Distance 5000.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.51,0:09:34.88,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,Equip HEAT rounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.34,0:09:36.55,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,Get into position.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.13,0:09:38.30,Italics,All,0,0,0,,Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.10,0:09:49.77,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.24,0:10:00.16,Italics,Theo,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.39,0:10:28.73,Main,Kiri,0,0,0,,Pale Rider to No-Face.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.73,0:10:31.11,Main,Kiri,0,0,0,,Prescribed firing schedule complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.40,0:10:36.32,Main,Kiri,0,0,0,,Special target with the call sign "Baleygr" \Nwas successfully lured in and destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.32,0:10:38.15,Main,Kiri,0,0,0,,The analysis was correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.15,0:10:41.41,Main,Kiri,0,0,0,,Baleygr could not detect the spare \Nwhen it was in sleep mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.41,0:10:43.74,Italics,No-Face,0,0,0,,No-Face to Pale Rider.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.74,0:10:46.12,Italics,No-Face,0,0,0,,Confirm Baleygr's destruction.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.33,0:10:51.79,Main,Kiri,0,0,0,,Pale Rider to No-Face. Unnecessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.79,0:10:54.13,Main,Kiri,0,0,0,,Baleygr was certainly destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.13,0:10:57.01,Italics,No-Face,0,0,0,,No-Face, roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.01,0:11:01.80,Italics,No-Face,0,0,0,,Leave your firing position, \Nand return to your designated district.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.35,0:11:06.39,Main,Kiri,0,0,0,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.52,0:11:16.44,Main,Kiri,0,0,0,,Survivors?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.66,0:11:26.20,Main,Kiri,0,0,0,,Maggots.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.54,0:11:29.04,Main,Kiri,0,0,0,,Do you think your little guns can defeat me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.59,0:11:37.17,Main,Kiri,0,0,0,,Baleygr!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.17,0:11:38.76,Main,Kiri,0,0,0,,It can still move?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.13,0:11:40.26,Main,Kiri,0,0,0,,Impossible...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.59,0:11:43.18,Main,Kiri,0,0,0,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.47,0:11:47.85,Main,Kiri,0,0,0,,You're still alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.43,0:11:56.94,Italics Top,Kiri,0,0,0,,I'll kill you! I'll kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.90,0:11:54.27,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,Still too far...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.78,0:12:03.07,Italics,Raiden,0,0,0,,Now what? Fire again, Shin?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.16,0:12:06.16,Italics,Raiden,0,0,0,,Shin!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.41,0:12:09.70,Italics,No-Face,0,0,0,,No-Face to Pale Rider.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.70,0:12:13.25,Italics,No-Face,0,0,0,,You are instructed to leave the enemy \Nto your escorts and withdraw.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.25,0:12:15.63,Main,Pale Rider,0,0,0,,Pale Rider to No-Face.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.63,0:12:17.88,Main,Pale Rider,0,0,0,,That order is unacceptable.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.88,0:12:20.05,Main,Pale Rider,0,0,0,,I'll destroy the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.05,0:12:22.17,Italics,No-Face,0,0,0,,No-Face to Pale Rider.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.17,0:12:23.26,Italics,No-Face,0,0,0,,I repeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.26,0:12:25.76,Italics,No-Face,0,0,0,,You are instructed to leave the enemy \Nto your escorts
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.76,0:12:27.93,Italics,No-Face,0,0,0,,and withdraw from the combat zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.89,0:12:31.18,Italics Top,Kiri,0,0,0,,I'll kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.81,0:12:31.85,Italics Top,Background,0,0,0,,Shin!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.23,0:12:35.02,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,If you make your desire to kill me \Nthat obvious, it's easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.14,0:12:34.69,Italics Top,Kiri,0,0,0,,I'll kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.44,0:12:35.02,Italics Top,Background,0,0,0,,What's wrong? Shin!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.31,0:12:39.40,Italics,No-Face,0,0,0,,The enemy Feldreß has the advantage \Nat this range.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.82,0:12:45.66,Italics,No-Face,0,0,0,,In addition, your weapons are likely \Nto be fatal to Baleygr.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.62,0:12:48.87,Italics Top,Background,0,0,0,,Shin! What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.20,0:12:51.33,Italics Top,Background,0,0,0,,Shin!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.58,0:12:53.57,Italics Top,Kiri,0,0,0,,I'll kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.79,0:12:59.34,Italics,No-Face,0,0,0,,For these reasons, you are not permitted \Nto participate in this battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.59,0:13:05.18,Italics,No-Face,0,0,0,,You are ordered to return to your\N designated district and fight there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.44,0:13:22.23,Italics,No-Face,0,0,0,,I repeat. You are to withdraw \Nfrom this combat area.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.86,0:13:26.99,Main,Kiri,0,0,0,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.91,0:13:36.08,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,I won't let him get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.00,0:13:37.92,Main,Kurena,0,0,0,,Shin!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.08,0:13:39.08,Italics,Theo,0,0,0,,Shin!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.33,0:13:39.79,Italics,Kurena,0,0,0,,What's wrong? Can't you hear me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.79,0:13:41.13,Italics,Anju,0,0,0,,Shin, can't you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.13,0:13:41.67,Italics,Raiden,0,0,0,,Shin!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.96,0:13:43.76,Italics,Raiden,0,0,0,,The Legion are back!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.76,0:13:45.34,Italics,Raiden,0,0,0,,They're going to surround us!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.34,0:13:46.88,Italics,Raiden,0,0,0,,What do we do, Shin?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.88,0:13:51.60,Italics,All,0,0,0,,Shin! Shin! Shin!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.56,0:13:58.02,Italics,Berhardt,0,0,0,,Follow the Morpho? \NAre you insane?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.25,0:14:02.52,Italics,Berhardt,0,0,0,,If we're all together, \Nwe can last until the main force gets here!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.90,0:14:07.53,Italics,Shin,0,0,0,,Our objective is to destroy the Morpho, \Nnot take this town.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.07,0:14:08.99,Italics,Shin,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.95,0:14:18.83,Italics,Bernhardt,0,0,0,,Why are you Eighty-Six so willing to risk your lives\N for a country that isn't even yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.75,0:14:21.54,Italics,Bernhardt,0,0,0,,Sheesh...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.54,0:14:24.46,Italics,Bernhardt,0,0,0,,My luck ran out \Nwhen I got you as my boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.46,0:14:26.30,Italics,Bernhardt,0,0,0,,This is gonna get me killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.67,0:14:29.30,Italics,Bernhardt,0,0,0,,Listen up, everybody! \NTurn around!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.89,0:14:33.81,Italics,Bernhardt,0,0,0,,You're in luck. You love hell, \Nand you're gonna get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.18,0:14:36.85,Italics,Bernhardt,0,0,0,,We'll handle this area.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.85,0:14:40.48,Italics,Bernhardt,0,0,0,,I hate to say it, but even \Nwe can't keep up with your mobility.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.48,0:14:43.57,Italics,Bernhardt,0,0,0,,I don't want to be the one \Nto slow you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.82,0:14:44.98,Italics,Bernhardt,0,0,0,,Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.83,0:14:53.70,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.25,0:15:03.71,Main,Kiri,0,0,0,,That mark...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.71,0:15:07.21,Main,Kiri,0,0,0,,It belongs to the Nouzen clan.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.97,0:15:11.22,Main,Kiri,0,0,0,,Follow me, Baleygr.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.59,0:15:12.93,Main,Kiri,0,0,0,,You're like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.93,0:15:16.22,Main,Kiri,0,0,0,,You have no place, \Nexcept on the battlefield...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.64,0:15:19.90,Main,Kiri,0,0,0,,But if you still intend to cling \Nto your pathetic life...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.32,0:16:17.16,Main,Kiri,0,0,0,,I'll teach you...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.91,0:16:21.91,Main,Kiri,0,0,0,,I'll destroy your comrades you command, \Nthe land you call home...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.91,0:16:26.34,Main,Kiri,0,0,0,,I'll burn them right in front of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.42,0:16:34.68,Main,Kiri,0,0,0,,I'll make it so you're all alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.30,0:16:52.01,sign_23888_202_Time_Since_Missi,Onscreen,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}Time Since Mission Began
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.51,0:16:38.35,Italics Top,Willem,0,0,0,,I want to confirm this again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.68,0:16:43.56,Italics Top,Willem,0,0,0,,Your small force moves much faster \Nthan an entire army.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.10,0:16:46.94,Italics Top,Willem,0,0,0,,We can't offer artillery support, \Nlet alone air support.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.94,0:16:48.52,Italics Top,Willem,0,0,0,,Or send reinforcements.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.15,0:16:51.99,Italics Top,Willem,0,0,0,,Will you still continue your pursuit?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.99,0:16:54.61,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,Fire support and reinforcements \Nfrom the main force
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.61,0:16:56.78,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,were never part the plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.16,0:16:58.87,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,There's no other way.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.87,0:17:03.50,Italics,Willem,0,0,0,,It's embarrassing \Nto hear you say that, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.71,0:17:05.71,Main,Willem,0,0,0,,Just because we left it to you once
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.71,0:17:09.29,Main,Willem,0,0,0,,doesn't mean it has to stay that way \Nonce the situation has changed. It's not fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.67,0:17:13.51,Main,Willem,0,0,0,,If you've changed your mind, \Nyou can fall back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.80,0:17:15.01,Italics,Shin,0,0,0,,You're joking.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.51,0:17:20.26,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,Every minute we spend retreating is a minute \Nthe Morpho gets deeper into Legion-held territory
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.72,0:17:22.89,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,and becomes harder to destroy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.89,0:17:24.98,Italics,Willem,0,0,0,,If you withdraw and are sent home,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.98,0:17:28.31,Italics,Willem,0,0,0,,it won't matter how difficult\N the mission is to accomplish.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.36,0:17:34.53,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,If we can't defeat the Morpho, \Nwe'll die anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.40,0:17:38.53,Italics,Shin,0,0,0,,Retreating today only to die tomorrow \Nis meaningless.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.70,0:17:41.08,Main,Willem,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.87,0:17:43.03,Main,Willem,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.54,0:17:45.16,Italics,Willem,0,0,0,,That's all from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.16,0:17:46.25,Italics,Willem,0,0,0,,Any questions?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.50,0:17:49.34,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.63,0:17:58.14,Dates,Onscreen,0,0,0,,Temporary Command Post\NEastern Kreutzbek City
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.73,0:18:08.73,Italics,Willem,0,0,0,,They weren't even slightly interested.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.73,0:18:11.86,Italics,Willem,0,0,0,,I guess their attention is elsewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.32,0:18:15.32,Italics,Willem,0,0,0,,I hate to say it, but they're going to die \Nin battle sooner or later.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.78,0:18:19.45,Italics,Willem,0,0,0,,They weren't even worried about you, \NI'm sad to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.45,0:18:21.12,Main,Grethe,0,0,0,,Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.12,0:18:24.20,Main,Grethe,0,0,0,,If I had kids ten years younger \Nworrying about me,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.20,0:18:26.46,Main,Grethe,0,0,0,,I'd die of shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.91,0:18:29.00,Main,Willem,0,0,0,,I'm sure you managed to avoid combat,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.00,0:18:31.42,Main,Willem,0,0,0,,but I'm still impressed \Nyou made it home alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.25,0:18:35.67,Main,Willem,0,0,0,,I see your skills are as sharp as ever, \NSpider-Woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.13,0:18:38.38,Main,Willem,0,0,0,,The Black Widow who slays the Legion.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.38,0:18:41.01,Main,Grethe,0,0,0,,Stop that, Murderous Praying Mantis.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.01,0:18:43.68,Main,Grethe,0,0,0,,You know where that name came from, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.68,0:18:47.56,Main,Willem,0,0,0,,Of course. \NI'm the one who came up with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.98,0:18:50.69,Main,Willem,0,0,0,,There aren't many brides \Nwho had to wear mourning clothes
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.69,0:18:54.44,Main,Willem,0,0,0,,for their husband's funeral \Nbefore they got to wear a wedding dress.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.44,0:18:55.86,Main,Grethe,0,0,0,,You're terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.86,0:19:00.57,Main,Willem,0,0,0,,The Major General and I were ready to annoy you \Nby filling the wedding hall with roses.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.16,0:19:03.20,Main,Willem,0,0,0,,This is what you get for rejecting me,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.20,0:19:05.62,Main,Willem,0,0,0,,and going with an idiot \Nwho left his wife behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.29,0:19:08.46,Main,Willem,0,0,0,,I don't care about the monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.08,0:19:13.04,Main,Willem,0,0,0,,But I don't want to see you \Ncrying over them again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.34,0:19:19.30,Italics,Frederica,0,0,0,,Meow! Meow! Meow!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.30,0:19:20.43,Main,Kurena,0,0,0,,A cat?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.43,0:19:21.68,Main,All,0,0,0,,Are you stupid?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.26,0:19:23.72,Main,Anju,0,0,0,,She's in heat.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.72,0:19:25.89,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,Open it, Fido.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.23,0:19:29.23,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,That's an order.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.23,0:19:30.27,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,Open it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.60,0:19:31.90,Italics,Frederica,0,0,0,,No, Fido!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.90,0:19:33.44,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,Don't open it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.24,0:19:42.49,Main,Theo,0,0,0,,What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.16,0:19:44.70,Main,Theo,0,0,0,,Why did you follow us?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.70,0:19:46.87,Main,Theo,0,0,0,,If something happens, \Nyou'll die with us!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.87,0:19:50.16,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,Because I don't like \Nthe way you think, fools!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.54,0:19:53.92,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,How long are you going to keep thinking
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.92,0:19:59.09,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,you're in District 86, \Nwhere you have to die?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.09,0:20:03.22,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,Even Ernst told you to come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.55,0:20:08.10,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,That is your task right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.77,0:20:12.60,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,I'm a hostage.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.81,0:20:14.69,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,Not to keep you from running \Nfrom the battlefield,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.06,0:20:18.73,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,but to keep you from running \Nfrom your duty to come home alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.53,0:20:25.49,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,Even you wouldn't want a frail little girl \Nlike me to die with you, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.04,0:20:36.00,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,Raiden, if I told you to take her back...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.00,0:20:37.29,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,Don't be ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.29,0:20:39.51,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,The only person who could do that \Nwould be you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.51,0:20:40.80,Main,Theo,0,0,0,,Really.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.80,0:20:44.47,Main,Theo,0,0,0,,I can't get past all the Legion \Nbetween us and the main force.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.47,0:20:46.64,Main,Kurena,0,0,0,,Want to go with Fido, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.05,0:20:49.01,Main,Anju,0,0,0,,I can't see that working.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.10,0:20:54.02,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,Fine. I'll take her.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.02,0:20:56.81,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,She won't fit \Nin anybody else's but mine, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.81,0:20:57.82,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.28,0:21:01.57,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,Never do this again.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.61,0:21:06.41,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,You didn't have to do this. \NWe're not going to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.28,0:21:09.45,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.45,0:21:10.74,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.75,0:21:13.50,Main,Anju,0,0,0,,Okay, let's eat lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.50,0:21:15.75,Main,Theo,0,0,0,,Yeah, we were getting it ready just now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.75,0:21:17.38,Main,Anju,0,0,0,,We'll need to make another.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.38,0:21:18.00,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,Frederica.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.71,0:21:21.21,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,You know how to use it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.34,0:21:26.93,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,If we get wiped out, and you can't \Nmeet up with the main army...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.43,0:21:29.56,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,Use it on yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.25,0:21:32.71,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.71,0:21:37.92,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,This is the gun you used \Non Eugene... your comrades.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.92,0:21:39.90,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,I told you to close your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.90,0:21:42.82,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,Fool. I saw your memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.47,0:21:46.85,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,You carry them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.88,0:21:56.43,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,It's too heavy for a frail little girl like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.76,0:21:59.58,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,I'm giving it right back to you \Nwhen we get back to base.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.53,0:22:03.55,Main Top,Frederica,0,0,0,,So make sure you come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.86,0:23:37.98,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,"Together unto death."
